{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "At Yellow Crane Tower, an old friend bids westward farewell;
In the mist and blossoms of March, he journeys east to Yangzhou.
His lone sail’s distant shadow fades into the boundless blue sky;
Only the River flows on, meeting the horizon’s edge."}

{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "Farewell, old friend, west of the Yellow Crane Tower—
amid the flower-mist of the third month, he drifts down to Yangzhou.
The lone sail's far shadow ends at the rim of blue sky;
all that is left is the Long River, flowing to the horizon."}

{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "My old friend bids Yellow Crane Tower farewell,
and sails east to Yangzhou through March's misty blossoms.
A lone sail—its far shadow lost in the boundless blue;
I see only the Long River flowing to the sky's rim."}

{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "My friend, west of the Yellow Crane Tower, takes his leave;
Amid flowers and mist in March, he sails down to Yangzhou.
A lone sail's far shadow dissolves into the endless blue—
I see but the Yangtze, flowing to the rim of the sky."}

{"source": {"title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵", "author": "李白", "text": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。
孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。"}, "translation": "My friend bids farewell to the Yellow Crane Tower in the west,
